The Claude Code wire-protocol types and state machines of hudhud were derived
independently from the observed behaviour of the Claude Code CLI. Where the
shape of a message follows the Claude Agent SDK for Python
(https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python), that SDK was used as
a reference under its MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025 Anthropic, PBC. No code
of that SDK, and no code of any proprietary Anthropic SDK, is included in
hudhud.

hudhud does not include or redistribute Claude Code. Claude Code is a product
of Anthropic, PBC, and is subject to Anthropic's own terms.

A package of hudhud that includes third-party code lists that code, with its
license notice, after this text in the package's own NOTICE file.

Third-party code in @hudhudjs/claude-code
=========================================

The generated validators of this package (src/generated/validators.gen.ts,
src/protocol/generated/validators.gen.ts and their compiled files in dist)
include, bundled by the schema pipeline (ADR-0005), the runtime helpers
dist/runtime/ucs2length.js and dist/runtime/equal.js of Ajv
(https://github.com/ajv-validator/ajv) and the fast-deep-equal library
(https://github.com/epoberezkin/fast-deep-equal). Both are licensed under
the MIT License; their license texts follow.

